# The image needs only the manifests, server/, and the shared directories server/ imports from (data/,
# utils/; whole, so a new shared file there cannot break the image). Everything else (the site, dist,
# .claude and its worktrees, node_modules, tests) stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server
!data
!utils
**/node_modules
**/__tests__
